# Placeholder config for the fleet confirm-gate lint (chrischall/workflows,
# reusable-mcp-ci.yml). NOT credentials — never put one here. The lint starts
# dist/bundle.js with an empty environment and reads its tools/list, but
# src/index.ts requires THERAPYPORTAL_PRACTICE at boot (the portal is
# per-practice), so without this line the server exits before answering. This
# code is not a real practice. With no credentials the server boots in bridge
# mode, touches no network at startup, and registers every tool.
THERAPYPORTAL_PRACTICE=placeholder00000
